	(text "Support circuit as on v1. Pin map from the .mfmc, checked against the as-built v1 copper:\nevery button keeps its ATmega pin. Chains: ANN_LOWER D22 SDI / D23 LE / D24 CLK,\nANN_UPPER D25 SDI / D26 CLK / D27 LE. New: D44 BL_PWM, D45 ANN_PWM, D46 TLC_PWR_EN.\nNO SMOKING (D5) moves to contact 1 on the SIGNS board: drop its inversion in MobiFlight."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
